- Bridge keeps the same +X heading and meadow-local line (z≈3.20) but ends 18 m out
  (was 24) just outside the terminus platform's SIDE rim next to the city's cloud bridge;
  the city is turned (yaw 241.17°) so the bridge arrives straight in. Deck walk is one
  diagonal to the cloud-bridge step + the unchanged 2.4 m arrival root (8.7+2.05 m, was 17.6 m).
  08-09 total 46.03 m (Build05 42.865 m): +2.64 s at the unchanged 1.2 m/s.
- journeyCamera takes an optional route focus (skycity: anchor_starcourt_center). Over the
  last 5→3 m the lens swings to 2.5 m behind her on the line to the plaza, 1.5 m up, aimed
  halfway between her chest and the plaza: city horizontally centred, both in frame.
  04-05 has no focus and is unchanged.
- test-journey-occlusion: O5 extra duration ≤3 s; city centre |ndc x|≤0.15, |y|≤0.35 and her
  chest in frame over the final 3 m. All occlusion checks and the 09 plaza check still pass.
